#. module: ai_mass_mailing
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_mass_mailing.ai_prompt_optout_reason
msgid ""
"Look at the records of the mailing subscription (model_name:  "
"mailing.subscription). Group them by the opt out reason (field_name: "
"opt_out_reason_id).\n"
"Ignore the \"Not specified\" or False values, those people did not provide "
"feedback.\n"
"Answer with the top 3 reasons for which people unsubscribe. The answer "
"should be a numbered list with the total for each reason between "
"parenthesis.\n"
"Example:\n"
"1. I'm not interested (64)\n"
"2. I receive too many emails (52)\n"
"3. I changed my mind (17)\n"
"After this list, offer to help me reduce it by giving me marketing "
"techniques.\n"
"Don't mention the model_name or field_name or any record ids in the response."
msgstr ""
"Consulta los registros de las suscripciones a correos (model_name: "
"mailing.subscription). Agrúpalos por el motivo de cancelación (field_name: "
"opt_out_reason_id).\n"
"Ignora los valores \"No especificado\" o \"Falso\", esas personas no "
"agregaron comentarios.\n"
"Responde con las primeras 3 razones por las que las personas cancelan su "
"suscripción. La respuesta debe ser una lista numerada con el total para cada "
"razón entre paréntesis.\n"
"Por ejemplo:\n"
"1. No me interesa (64)\n"
"2. Recibo muchos correos (52)\n"
"3. Cambié de parecer (17)\n"
"Después de esta lista, dame ideas que me ayuden a reducir estos números con "
"técnicas de marketing.\n"
"No menciones el model_name ni el field_name o cualquier id de registro en la "
"respuesta."
